 "transcript_start": "I've taken more notes in the past 2 years than high school and college combined and in those same 2 years I went from a broke restaurant server to now doing my dream job posting on Instagram or whatever. So, please let me try to convince you to start writing every single day. I have an analogy and then I'm going to explain my journaling system and hopefully that'll be enough. So, if you want to look your best then your number one tool is a mirror",
